This product is an overlay app for the F4HWN firmware for the Quansheng
UV-K1 and UV-K5 V3 radios:

  https://github.com/armel/uv-k1-k5v3-firmware-custom

It is built against the overlay-app SDK of that firmware (app_api.h,
app_overlay.h, app_assets.py, pack_app.py), Copyright 2026 Armel F4HWN,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The SDK files are not
included in this repository; tools/fetch_sdk.py downloads them.

build.sh and app.ld are based on the build script and linker script of the
F4HWN overlay apps.

The standalone repository layout and GitHub Actions workflow follow the
pattern of Temp 433 (https://github.com/Maciekbac/temp433).

Frame layouts follow the device notes of rtl_433
(https://github.com/merbanan/rtl_433), used as a specification only.
